/**
 * Converts a DER-encoded byte buffer to an OID dot-separated string. The
 * byte buffer should contain only the DER-encoded value, not any tag or
 * length bytes.
 *
 * @param bytes the byte buffer.
 *
 * @return the OID dot-separated string.
 */
